{"id":"gesellschaft","lemma":"Gesellschaft","pos":"noun","rank":874,"glosses":["company (presence of other people in general)","company (group of people)","society, the public (abstract concept of an organised social group or a local population in general)"],"ipa":"/ɡəˈzɛlʃaft/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4c/De-Gesellschaft.ogg/De-Gesellschaft.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Gesellschaft","plural":"Gesellschaften"},"examples":[{"text":"Willst du etwas Gesellschaft haben?","en":"Do you want some company?","words":[{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"something"},null,{"g":"have"}]},{"text":"Wir sind in guter Gesellschaft.","en":"We're in good company.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Wir haben wieder Gesellschaft.","en":"We've got company again.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"again"},null]},{"text":"Ich fühle mich in seiner Gesellschaft wohl.","en":"I feel comfortable in his company.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to feel","l":"fühlen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"his"},null,{"g":"possibly, probably"}]},{"text":"Er ist eine Gefahr für die Gesellschaft.","en":"He is a danger to society.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"danger"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}